        "text": "Let $m$ and $n$ be coprime natural numbers, with a fixed power $k$. The divisors of $mn$ that\n    can be expressed as perfect $k$-powers are exactly the product of the divisors of $m$ and $n$\n    that can be expressed as perfect $k$-powers."
